;==================================================
;411,戦闘訓練
;TFLAG:194(3=夏の昼間 2=ヤバい天気 1=悪天候 0=屋内or通常天気
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K92_411
CALL M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K92_411_1
RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K92_411_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	SELECTCASE RAND:8
	CASE 1
		PRINTFORMW 「Thy Danmaku may be thy sword, but 'tis also thy shield! When thy enemy attempts a graze, that is thy cue to boldly charge in to strike a blow!」
		PRINTFORMW 「A battle must always be fought on a favorable field!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Look here, fight not in just thy naked state! Make use of thy Danmaku to keep me in check!」
	CASE 2
		PRINTFORMW 「Bide thy time when thy opponent makes a move, for there shall open a chink in their armor when they land!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Guide thy enemy by use of thy fire, thou must manipulate his movements as if he were a puppet on a string!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Lure him into the place he wishes to escape! And there dispatch him!」
	CASE 3
		PRINTFORMW 「To anticipate thy opponent's movements, thou must always think one step ahead!」
		PRINTFORMW 「'Tis unnecessary to rely on mere chance! Learn the habits of thy opponent, predict him, and take full advantage!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Once thou knows thy foe, make pretense to play to his favorite pattern——and then end him rightly with an unexpected twist!」
	CASE 4
		PRINTFORMW 「Thou must always remember the opportune space for thy foe as well as thy self!」
		PRINTFORMW 「There is no need to do battle in a place where he has the advantage! Thou must take the fight to a field which suits thee instead!」
	CASE 5
		PRINTFORMW 「Fight in such a way that thy opponent cannot develop his own stratagem!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Thou must force upon thy foe what he hates, and for thyself thou must force what benefits thee!」
		PRINTFORMW 「'Tis essential to sniff out thy opponent's plans! And then assert thine own instead!」
	CASE 6
		PRINTFORMW 「Battles may be waged by means of logic and tactics, but by subterfuge and misdirection are they won!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Commence with a straightforwards attack! Then, when thy enemy feels comfortable——unleash an unexpected move!」
	CASE 7
		PRINTFORMW 「Who plans much, wins! Who plans little, wins not! To say nothing of he who plans not at all!」
		PRINTFORMW 「To bring victory within thy grasp, thou must increase thy preparations!」
		PRINTFORMW 「If thou has not divined the techniques to reach victory, thou cannot win! Thou must make provision for every possible means of attack!」
	CASEELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「He who fights casually shall meet nothing but defeat!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Thou must ever seize the initiative for thyself! Control the ebb and flow of the battle!」
		PRINTFORMW 「To leave thy foe no room for comfort and no time for thought, that is my philosophy for true battle!」
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
RETURN 1
